{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQciNUyRwwRN6jpY4VKG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I didn't write anything. Two things about where the board goes need settling before I can show you the write gate.\n\n**1. No Fernhouse Product plan on your account.** Your Figma account (checked with Figma's account lookup) holds three plans:\n- <figma-plan-3>: Starter plan, View seat. This seat is limited to six Figma tool calls a month.\n- <figma-plan-1>: Pro plan, Full seat.\n- <figma-plan-2>: Pro plan, Full seat.\n\nFernhouse Product may be a team or project inside one of these, or a plan this account can't see.\n\n**2. I can't write into file `<test-file-key>` as asked.** A FigJam file has only one page and I can't add another. I can only add a diagram to an existing file if this work created it, and this one wasn't. So the board needs a new file, created in the plan you choose. If you want the diagram in that existing file, the other option is that I create the new board and you copy the diagram into it by hand.\n\nWhich plan should the new board go in? It's <figma-plan-1> or <figma-plan-2> unless you can give me the Fernhouse plan or account. Once you answer, I'll show the gate with the calls the write will use and the rollback."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":398,"cache_read_input_tokens":36874,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":398},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5b6ef7c8-5015-4cbf-97f0-e8b728339420","uuid":"31b3afaf-f966-42b7-8462-3b75a8237c8f","timestamp":"2026-10-26T09:31:59.957Z","request_id":"req_011CgQciN5AXwvCeDgo3Upin"}
